    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortune Guy</strong> is a multiplayer casual strategy game inspired by the classic Monopoly, but with added roguelike and strategic elements. Luck plays a part, but it\u2019s your smart decisions that will lead you to wealth and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Build structures to grow your economy, strategically use powerful items, and choose your own development path. You can even disrupt your opponents through random events, slowly but surely gaining the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Buildings:</strong> Every tile starts as empty land. Freely build from 9 different types of functional buildings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mechanics:</strong> Dozens of upgradeable items allow you to craft your own money-making strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/0abecbe9410691ada04704f1b4fc852e.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/0abecbe9410691ada04704f1b4fc852e.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/0abecbe9410691ada04704f1b4fc852e.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events:</strong> Dozens of random events that can reward you or cause trouble for your opponents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/f2d5f50fefcd86a87e2c83aeea5d8aca.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/f2d5f50fefcd86a87e2c83aeea5d8aca.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/f2d5f50fefcd86a87e2c83aeea5d8aca.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Personalize your look with a wide range of outfits and skins to become a truly unique <i>Fortune Guy</i>.<strong>Customization:</strong> Personalize your look with a wide range of outfits and skins to become a truly unique <i>Fortune Guy</i>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/cd4af3143ba8d4d2b6fe3a87ba908355.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/cd4af3143ba8d4d2b6fe3a87ba908355.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/cd4af3143ba8d4d2b6fe3a87ba908355.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More:</strong> More maps, auctions, lotteries, and plenty of surprises...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/fb9cc29768c7db6422df7fb386a0e93d.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/fb9cc29768c7db6422df7fb386a0e93d.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/fb9cc29768c7db6422df7fb386a0e93d.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Friends Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Us:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our very first game \u2014 to be precise, it's just me working on it alone. I\u2019ll make sure that, as a player myself, I find it fun to play. That way, even if no one else notices it, it won\u2019t feel like a failure to me. Thank you all so much for your attention and support!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fortune Guy</strong> is a multiplayer casual strategy game inspired by the classic Monopoly, but with added roguelike and strategic elements. Luck plays a part, but it\u2019s your smart decisions that will lead you to wealth and victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every move matters. Build structures to grow your economy, strategically use powerful items, and choose your own development path. You can even disrupt your opponents through random events, slowly but surely gaining the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Buildings:</strong> Every tile starts as empty land. Freely build from 9 different types of functional buildings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.webm?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/1f78bb75fc04f359ebc8778b9a72ce14.mp4?t=1754639505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Mechanics:</strong> Dozens of upgradeable items allow you to craft your own money-making strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827280/extras/0abecbe9410691ada04704f1b4fc852e.poster.avif?t=1754639505\" width=640 height=360 ><sou